 for concern?</article-title><source>The Journal of Laryngology &#x00026; Otology</source><year>1993</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>356</fpage><lpage>58</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8320529</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ku</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Kew</surname><given-names>QJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Van-Hassel</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spontaneous retropharyngeal haematoma in a parathyroid adenoma</article-title><source>The Australian &#x00026; New Zealand Journal of Surgery</source><year>1998</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>619</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9715147</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1445-2197.1998.tb02117.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sandor</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooke</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spontaneous cervico-mediastinal haematoma</article-title><source>The British Journal of Surgery</source><year>1964</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>682</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14222573</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/bjs.1800510909</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Paleri</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Maroju</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Ali</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruckley</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Spontaneous retro- and parapharyngeal haematoma caused by intra-thyroid bleed</article-title><source>The Journal of Lary